        <div class="text-center mb-5">
            <h3 class="h2 text-primary font-heading fw-bold mb-2">Built for New-to-Credit MSMEs</h3>
            <p class="text-secondary mx-auto" style="max-width: 600px;">
                No credit bureau file needed. FinRiskLens AI checks the records a registered business
                already has, with the owner's consent at every step.
            </p>
        </div>

