                        <h4 class="h5 text-primary font-heading fw-bold">Consented Data, Not a Bureau File</h4>
                        <p class="small text-secondary mb-4">
                            Business registry, tax and sales, income tax, banking and corporate registry
                            records, each checked separately and scored 0–100 with reasons.
                        </p>
                        <ul class="list-unstyled mb-0">
                            <li class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 small text-dark font-data fw-semibold mb-2">
                                <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-secondary fs-5"></i>
                                Start with your Udyam Registration Number
